{"version":1,"content":"<p>出道25周年的日本歌姬中島美嘉，將於明年5月29日假亞博Arena舉行相隔3年的第2次個人演唱會。</p><p>來港開騷前，美嘉宣布相隔8年再拍劇，參演明年1月首播的朝日電視台新劇《SMELLOCK》。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;她於《S</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.584665+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:09:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:39.419101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:39.419101+00:00","content_hash":"3e91d3b2ec2f74c4bf0c890a7a8322eab28a48958e2c5044e1bdbb5c2e7391d7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}